                                                "sense_id": "a5f0b829-c5be-3b95-b5df-c7076c892109",
                                                "text": "The vote was 54-46. The vote was mostly along party lines though Democratic Sen. John Fetterman of Pennsylvania joined Republicans in supporting Bondi."
